battle_bg.c: the remake layer learns the battle background is the main one.

DrawMainBattleBackground draws the place's background (at the battle's start,
after a menu, and when a move's background is taken down); the remake
layer's hook records it, so the remake shows its arena in its place.

--- a/src/battle_bg.c
